1 0 0 1 45 797.00 Tm (CodeNergy Website ? Development Handover Report) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 783.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 769.00 Tm (#1\) Project Overview) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 755.00 Tm (CodeNergy Website is a full-stack Next.js application that includes:) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 741.00 Tm (- A public marketing site with service pages, portfolio, blog, FAQ, contact, and careers pages.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 727.00 Tm (- An admin panel for content and operations management \(services, projects, users, team,) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 713.00 Tm (testimonials, appointments, messages, FAQs, blog\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 699.00 Tm (- Backend APIs built in the Next.js App Router \(`src/app/api/`\) using MongoDB + Mongoose.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 685.00 Tm (- Authentication based on JWT + cookie sessions for admin users.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 671.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 657.00 Tm (#2\) Tech Stack) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 643.00 Tm (##Frontend) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 629.00 Tm (- Next.js `^16.0.7`) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 615.00 Tm (- React / React DOM `^19.2.1`) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 601.00 Tm (- Tailwind CSS v4 + PostCSS) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 587.00 Tm (- Framer Motion, Swiper, React Icons, React Modal) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 573.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 559.00 Tm (##Backend / Data) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 545.00 Tm (- Next.js API route handlers \(`route.js`\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 531.00 Tm (- MongoDB with Mongoose) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 517.00 Tm (- JWT auth \(`jsonwebtoken`, `jose`\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 503.00 Tm (- Password hashing via `bcryptjs`) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 489.00 Tm (- Email notifications via Nodemailer \(SMTP\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 475.00 Tm (- Cloudinary for image/media hosting) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 461.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 447.00 Tm (##State / Tooling) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 433.00 Tm (- Redux Toolkit + React Redux) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 419.00 Tm (- ESLint 9 + `eslint-config-next`) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 405.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 391.00 Tm (#3\) Repository Structure) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 377.00 Tm (- `src/app/\(site\)`: Public-facing site routes and layout.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 363.00 Tm (- `src/app/\(admin\)`: Admin login + admin dashboard pages.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 349.00 Tm (- `src/app/api`: Backend APIs \(App Router route handlers\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 335.00 Tm (- `src/components/landings`: Public site components.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 321.00 Tm (- `src/components/admin`: Admin UI shell and editor components.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 307.00 Tm (- `src/models`: Mongoose schemas/models.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 293.00 Tm (- `src/lib`: shared utilities \(DB, Cloudinary, auth helper, mailer\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 279.00 Tm (- `src/redux`: Redux store and user slice.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 265.00 Tm (- `src/configs/middleware.js`: middleware protecting admin dashboard routes.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 251.00 Tm (- `public/`: static assets and uploaded media snapshots.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 237.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 223.00 Tm (#4\) Environment Variables \(Required\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 209.00 Tm (Create `.env.local` with at least:) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 195.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 181.00 Tm (- `MONGODB_URI`: primary MongoDB connection string.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 167.00 Tm (- `JWT_SECRET`: signing secret for JWT token/cookie authentication.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 153.00 Tm (- `SMTP_HOST`: SMTP host for outbound mail.) Tj
