1 0 0 1 45 643.00 Tm (#6\) Runtime Architecture and Request Flow) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 629.00 Tm (1. Browser hits public pages or admin pages.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 615.00 Tm (2. Public pages fetch content from `/api/*` routes.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 601.00 Tm (3. Admin pages use cookie-based auth \(`userInfo`, `token`\) and call protected APIs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 587.00 Tm (4. API handlers call `connectDB\(\)` and operate through Mongoose models.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 573.00 Tm (5. Some mutating endpoints also:) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 559.00 Tm (   - write audit activity records to `Activities` collection,) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 545.00 Tm (   - notify admins via SMTP email.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 531.00 Tm (6. Uploaded images are stored through Cloudinary and/or local upload paths under `public/uploads`) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 517.00 Tm (depending on route logic.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 503.00 Tm () Tj
