1 0 0 1 45 475.00 Tm (- Login endpoint validates email/password and sets cookies \(`/api/auth/login`\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 461.00 Tm (- Middleware verifies JWT token cookie and blocks unauthenticated access for dashboard matcher) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 447.00 Tm (paths.) Tj
