1 0 0 1 45 755.00 Tm (#12\) Frontend Notes) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 741.00 Tm (- Global public layout includes SEO metadata, navbar/footer, and WhatsApp floating button.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 727.00 Tm (- Home page fetches services + testimonials from APIs and composes multiple landing sections.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 713.00 Tm (- Service navigation is dynamic and multi-level in the navbar.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 699.00 Tm (- Admin area is rendered through server layout + client provider for Redux hydration.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 685.00 Tm (- Rich text/editor related admin components exist \(`Editor.js`, `SlateDisplay.js`\) based on Slate.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 671.00 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 45 657.00 Tm (#13\) Operational Notes \(Important for New Developer\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 643.00 Tm (1. Auth cookies are central: keep cookie names/shape consistent \(`token`, `userInfo`\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 629.00 Tm (2. Most admin APIs expect `verifyAdmin\(\)`: maintain that contract for new endpoints.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 615.00 Tm (3. DB connection helper is singleton-like \(`isConnected`\) to avoid repeated connects.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 601.00 Tm (4. Email notifications are triggered on several write operations; check SMTP in each environment.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 587.00 Tm (5. Cloudinary domain is whitelisted in `next.config.mjs` for image rendering.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 573.00 Tm (6. Naming inconsistencies exist \(`testinomials` typo, some route naming style differences\). Avoid) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 559.00 Tm (breaking existing paths unless migrating end-to-end.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 545.00 Tm () Tj
