1 0 0 1 45 489.00 Tm (- Some client components use patterns now flagged by stricter React/Next lint rules.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 475.00 Tm (- Route and naming consistency can be improved \(`Activities` uppercase route, `testinomials`) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 461.00 Tm (spelling\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 447.00 Tm (- Error handling and validation depth varies by endpoint.) Tj
1 0 0 1 45 433.00 Tm (- No automated tests are currently present.) Tj
